# D3-LI-003: Curcumin colour and a neutral solvent blank
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 water 45mL
add v1 ethanol 5mL
add v1 curcumin 0.000001mol
add v2 water 45mL
add v2 ethanol 5mL
measure v1 uvvis
measure v2 uvvis
add v1 Na2CO3 0.00001mol
add v2 Na2CO3 0.00001mol
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
measure v1 uvvis
measure v2 uvvis
inspect
